# Shopify Translator: Translate Shopify Apps & Admin in Chrome

Shopify is used by merchants around the world, but not every Shopify app is available in every language.

If you manage a Shopify store and use apps that are only available in English, a Shopify translator can make the experience much easier.

**Page Translate** lets you translate Shopify Admin, Shopify apps, web pages, and selected text directly in Chrome.

## What is a Shopify translator?

A Shopify translator is a browser-based translation tool that helps translate text and interfaces while using Shopify.

Instead of changing the language of the entire store, you can translate the Shopify Admin or a specific Shopify app while you work.

This is useful when:

- A Shopify app only supports English
- Your Shopify Admin is easier to use in another language
- You work with stores in different countries
- You manage multiple Shopify apps
- You need to understand an unfamiliar app interface

## How to translate Shopify apps

With Page Translate, you can translate a Shopify app directly from your browser.

1. Install Page Translate.
2. Open Shopify Admin.
3. Open the Shopify app you want to use.
4. Open Page Translate.
5. Select your target language.
6. Translate the page.

The translation happens while you are using the app, so you don't need to wait for the app developer to add another language.

## Translate Shopify Admin

Page Translate can also translate Shopify Admin pages.

This can be useful for merchants who prefer working in a language other than the default language provided by Shopify.

You can translate the page instead of changing your entire Shopify store configuration.

## Translate selected text

You don't always need to translate an entire page.

If you only need to understand a button, setting, message, or paragraph, you can translate selected text instead.

## Who is Shopify Translator for?

### Shopify merchants

Merchants can use Shopify apps in a preferred language even when the app does not provide that language.

### Shopify agencies

Agencies working with international merchants can translate Shopify Admin and third-party apps while managing stores.

### Shopify developers

Developers can use translation while testing Shopify apps or working with stores in different languages.

